    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A total of 162 residents and fellows - many of whom have played a crucial role in treating COVID-19 patients during the pandemic - graduated at Aga Khan University Medical College's 26th Postgraduate Medical Education, PGME, ceremony on Saturday.",
